  "question": "Which hotel can I find within 100 kilometers while progressing toward Tracy Medical Offices, Tracy, CA from Cogswell University of Silicon Valley, San Jose, CA?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-121.941 37.414064)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-121.456856 37.75575)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'hotel'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-121.941 37.414064)',4326)::geography, 100000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-121.941 37.414064)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
